ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200549315353_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200549315353_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【阿森纳时隔22年英超夺冠】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0c80aea2858native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">终结22年等待！阿森纳提前1轮加冕英超冠军 夺第14座顶级联赛锦标</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260519/202605192326339772.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260519/202605192326339772.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260519/202605192326339772.jpg"> </div><p>曼城1-1战平伯恩茅斯丢分，阿森纳提前一轮锁定英超冠军。阿森纳时隔22年首次捧起英超冠军奖杯！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0c88e51ccd9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">教授，我们做到了！阿尔特塔夺得温格后英超首冠 3连亚后终攀巅峰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200044264891.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200044264891.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200044264891.jpg"> </div><p>阿森纳提前一轮锁定英超冠军。阿森纳终结英超三连亚，温格后首次捧起英超冠军奖杯！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0cca68b069cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">温格祝贺阿森纳夺冠：你们做到了，这是你们的时刻，继续前进吧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.04" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200439111603.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.04" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.04" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200439111603.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260520/202605200439111603.jpg"> </div><p>阿森纳提前一轮夺得2025/26赛季英超冠军，温格为枪手送上祝贺。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0c75ac8df82native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">7年终登顶！阿尔特塔夺执教生涯首座联赛冠军 此前1足总杯2社区盾</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.35" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/69fb29c1796df.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.35" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.35" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/69fb29c1796df.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260506/69fb29c1796df.jpg"> </div><p>阿森纳提前一轮锁定本赛季英超联赛冠军，阿尔特塔执教阿森纳七年首夺联赛冠军。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0c857c60734native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">下一站，欧洲之巅！阿森纳5月31日冲击队史首座欧冠、大号双冠王</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0cc72fb0269native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">22年的等待！阿森纳官方发文：枪手是英超冠军</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0c79c3c6d86native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">苦尽甘来！阿森纳摆脱三连亚魔咒，此前两度遭曼城压制无缘冠军</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0ccc1fb6c40native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">霸气！阿森纳夺得英超冠军，官推将头像改成“金色大炮”</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0ccd4e1051fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冠军大合影！赖斯晒出大家一起看球：当时都说了..结束了🏆❤️</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0cd0bd74416native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">我们是冠军！阿森纳球员振臂高呼肆意欢跳，尽情享受夺冠时刻</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0ccfb7c2ba5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">瓜帅：恭喜阿森纳夺冠，恭喜阿尔特塔和球员们，你们实至名归</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0cd30499f4cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">老队长！扎卡社媒三连：请给予阿尔特塔尊重，祝贺阿森纳大家庭！</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0cba7e2fcd1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">逆天战绩！伯恩茅斯17轮不败距第5红军3分，送枪手提前夺冠</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0cbba7ab483native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这次是你掉链子！曼城原本手握争冠主动权，但平埃弗顿、樱桃</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/6a0cb9fd88f76native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打自己脸！水瓶哥此前因嘲讽阿森纳走红，今天见证曼城无缘冠军</a></p><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/match1713739date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">送阿森纳提前夺冠！曼城1-1伯恩茅斯 樱桃17轮不败哈兰德扳平</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260520/zhanbao_image_1713739_1779222273_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260520/zhanbao_image_1713739_1779222273_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260520/zhanbao_image_1713739_1779222273_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>克鲁皮破门，哈兰德绝平，曼城1-1伯恩茅斯，送枪手提前夺冠；伯恩茅斯17轮不败。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-20/match1713742date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">升至第8！切尔西2-1热刺终结7轮不胜 恩佐传射热刺领先降级区2分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260520/zhanbao_image_1713742_1779224663_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: 